  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-B9FUPoAP\">工具采用标准的Javascript语法，在此基础上延展了部分特定的语法</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-uSKJAL6Z\" id=\"h346b9f0-uSKJAL6Z\">入口函数</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-pGPZvyJZ\">一个脚本会有一个main函数作为整个程序的执行起始点</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22export%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22disabled%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22vtaIt%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-5BYDk8kR\">脚本在执行运行命令之后会优先运行该函数，请在main函数范围内进行程序的编写</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-5iA7ghBg\" id=\"h346b9f0-5iA7ghBg\">预定义类</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-T72lBchi\">与MAPI不同的是，我们对涉及到了广告业务的对象都做了实例化</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OX6sqsmV\">我们将包装好所有可直接调用的方法，你可以直接调用免去自行封装的麻烦</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-lazcL2F2\">具体的类和方法，你可以查看【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/39/docs/1781433580513280\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">Mapi</a>】</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-eYOCMCcd\" id=\"h346b9f0-eYOCMCcd\">常用写法</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%20%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%20main%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%20*%2F%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E3%80%82%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E9%83%BD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%20const%5Cn%20%20const%20advs%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E3%80%82%E5%BD%93%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%B4%AF%E5%8A%A0%E8%AE%A1%E6%95%B0%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%20let%5Cn%20%20let%20count%20%3D%201%3B%5Cn%20%20count%20%2B%3D%201%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20return%20'ok'%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%5Cnfunction%20checkAdv(adv)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20console.log(adv)%3B%5Cn%20%20return%20true%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Evy8P%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-23b9BhY4\" id=\"h346b9f0-23b9BhY4\">了解更多</h1><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-83SmJml7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jZK63P8Q\">脚本工具支持完整 ES6 语法</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mOgfDbcQ\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.babeljs.cn/docs/learn#%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8E-lexical-this\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">变量声明 var / let / const</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8QkGMFUc\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.babeljs.cn/docs/learn#%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8E-lexical-this\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">函数与箭头函数</a></li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-OPZ9EaiO\"><br></p></div>",
